<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "avemaria.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\山車道.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>Though this is only what I was told.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What the local police saw first was <STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>, sitting on the ground <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="ぼうぜん">in a daze</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花倒れる.gal" "WAIT" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
Beside her, collapsed on the asphalt, <STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE>.<PG>
An ambulance arrived along with the police, and both of my <STYLE ID="2">senpai</STYLE> were carried off to a nearby hospital.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There was nobody who looked like the culprit, and at the scene there were brake marks from a car.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> was probably hit by the car the shinigami was riding in ― that is the inference. [TN: shinigami: a god of death]
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And yet, brake marks.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\病院待合室.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> was not hurt, but <STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> was in a condition where every second counted.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Emergency surgery was carried out, but the chance of saving her was said to be low.<PG>
I reached the hospital and waited in the waiting area with <STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> for the surgery to end.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> did not answer when I called to her; the whole time,
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">... </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
she went on murmuring, like someone delirious.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What had <STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> seen at the scene?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She must have seen the moment <STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> was hit, and the moment the culprit fled.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"It's because I asked her to help me... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">If I had not asked </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> to protect me―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> was mumbling to herself in a low voice, her gaze angled down, staring at some point with unfocused eyes.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, it's all right. I'll be right beside you the whole time."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Y-yes! What is it!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
More than 4 hours had passed since <STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> was found, and at last she looked my way.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What had <STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE> seen? What did <STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE> know?<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, she... </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">she was done in."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"B-by whom!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">The shinigami."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Shi...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had a feeling <STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> had said something like that on the phone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But it can only be <STYLE ID="7" RUBY="・・・">that person</STYLE>, wearing a disguise.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"The shinigami is </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s dad."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Huh...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
An answer came back that differed from my own deduction.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Had <STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> lost her mind?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Or was she saying exactly what she had seen?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had no idea what else I should say.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢全身.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, sorry about this... keeping you out this late. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">Any minute now, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Kogori-san's mother</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> is supposed to get here from Motoki Police Station."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Kogori-senpai's mother</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> only?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Would you come over here a moment?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Was it hard for him to talk in front of <STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Of course it would be. After all, <STYLE ID="10">Niimura-senpai's mother</STYLE> is...<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, I'll be right back."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"It's all right, I'll stay somewhere well inside </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">'s field of view. That is fine, isn't it? </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Mister</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Yeah, just a little way off."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"............"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1,000,人物2" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\病院待合室2.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"So the culprit of this incident is, after all..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had been thinking about it the whole time.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No matter how I looked at it, I could only think that <STYLE ID="10">Niimura-senpai's mother</STYLE> was the suspicious one.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It clashed with the account of the only witness, <STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>, though...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢考えるバストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"About that... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">A little while ago, </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Mifuyu Niimura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">'s body was found... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">Her house caught fire, and the body was burned..."</STYLE><PG>
Surely not! A suicide, because she thought she was cornered...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But as a suicide with being the culprit for its reason, it is inexplicable.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Leave aside <STYLE ID="3">her daughter Niimura-senpai</STYLE> ― she left <STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> unharmed, and then killed herself?<PG>
From fleeing the scene to killing herself, would that come to about 4 hours?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In terms of time that is perfectly possible, but...<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Mister</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">... that is strange, isn't it... Then what did she chase both of my </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> around for..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Yeah. If it was suicide, I have no idea at all why she would die..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If <STYLE ID="10">Niimura-senpai's mother</STYLE> is the culprit, her actions do not match up at all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Is the culprit a different person...? Or was there a reason I cannot understand...?<PG>
Is the shinigami's true identity really <STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE>'s father after all?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, I do not believe that! It has to be an elaborate trick!<PG>
In any case, considering <STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>'s age and when <STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE>'s father died, it is no wonder she does not remember his face.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So <STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>'s testimony cannot be relied on.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I will go on assuming that the culprit is <STYLE ID="10">Niimura-senpai's mother</STYLE>.<PG>
Settle on a hypothesis, carry out the verification, and correct it if there is an error.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A dead person as the culprit, that is simply impossible.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"Keep the theory that </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Mifuyu Niimura</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> is the culprit between us. I'm going to search </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Mifuyu Niimura</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">'s house. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, sorry, but... stay with </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, would you."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Of course. That was my intention from the start. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">And also..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I straightened up to face <STYLE ID="8">Ise-san</STYLE>.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Assistant Inspector Ise</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">. Thank you very much for going to such lengths for the people I care about!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I bowed as deeply as I possibly could.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"No, it is wrong for me to be thanked. I am the one who has to apologize. In the end I was no use at all... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">I let the culprit get away, and on top of that </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Niimura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> ended up like that... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">I am truly sorry."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\自動ドア.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\自動ドア.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">Ise-san</STYLE> left those words behind and set off from the hospital.<PG>
No, <STYLE ID="8">you</STYLE> truly did everything you could.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I am grateful from the bottom of my heart.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHGVOL "BGM" "800" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\アスファルトダッシュ.ogg" "VOICE2" "NORMAL" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE2" "1000" "3000" "WAIT"}
{PLAYSND "SE\自動ドア.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\自動ドア.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{STOPSND "VOICE2" "1000" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
And then, as if changing places with him, <STYLE ID="9">Kogori-senpai's mother</STYLE> came rushing in.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Oh, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Auntie</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">! </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> is safe!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I called out like that, <STYLE ID="9">Auntie</STYLE> stopped where she was and looked toward <STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Haah... thank goodness...!</STYLE> <STYLE ID="9">Really, thank goodness..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">Auntie</STYLE> let out a cry of <STYLE ID="11" RUBY="あんど">relief</STYLE>.<PG>
But,
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">, what about her!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
　<STYLE ID="10">Mifuyu</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">... what happened to her!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Huh...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Straight away her expression changed again and she was shouting at me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I felt an unaccountable wrongness in this manner of <STYLE ID="9">Auntie</STYLE>'s.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It is natural enough to worry about <STYLE ID="10">Niimura-senpai's mother</STYLE> and her family, friends of hers from long ago, but...<PG>
And at that moment, a hypothesis took shape inside me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A hypothesis with truly no grounds at all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Rather than a hypothesis...
{PAUSE ""}
a guess.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But if that is so... Should I say this...?<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Auntie</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I looked steadily into <STYLE ID="9">Auntie</STYLE>'s eyes.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"............</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">............!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I could see <STYLE ID="9">Auntie</STYLE>'s expression changing before my eyes.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"W-what is it...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"You know, don't you? The reason all this happened..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">... that is..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, could it be that the two of them..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When she heard me say that, <STYLE ID="9">Auntie</STYLE> let out a great sigh.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Of course... that's </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> for you... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">To get this far on nothing but that much information..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Unfortunately, it seems my hypothesis was right.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But... even if it is so, when I think about <STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What on earth is there that I can do...<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"When I think about </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">... I cannot tell </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Auntie</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> what to do, but..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="12">I</STYLE> fixed <STYLE ID="9">Auntie</STYLE>'s face with a sharp <STYLE ID="13" RUBY="にら">glare</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"But... that is why... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">that is why I cannot forgive </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">Auntie</STYLE> kept her eyes on mine without looking away, and stayed silent.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"You're right. What we did was wrong after all. That is why it has come to this..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So <STYLE ID="9">Auntie</STYLE> too had committed a wrong...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then I will not repeat the same wrong.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So... as for what I can do...!<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Then... then...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
　<STYLE ID="6">Then please turn yourself in!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
At last <STYLE ID="9">Auntie</STYLE> turned her eyes away from me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And another great sigh.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Turning myself in... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">You're right, I have to make all of it public. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> ― find a good way to tell her, would you... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">The patrol car that brought me here is outside, so I will go and talk to them."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">Auntie</STYLE> headed for the hospital exit without speaking to <STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Aren't you going to say anything to </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\茜.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "650" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"I cannot face </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">that girl</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> anymore... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">I'm sorry, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\自動ドア.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
