{PLAYSND "SE\自動ドア.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">Auntie</STYLE> left those words behind and went outside.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Left behind, I... could not make a sound, and shook with anger.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I hung my head and clenched my fists tight―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My body shook with anger at the person who caused this, and at the person who could have stopped it and did not.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ横顔前逆.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Just now... wasn't </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> here?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>, gone as hollow as an empty shell, stared outside with vacant eyes.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Outside, the patrol car's light bar was revolving, with no thought for the inpatients it disturbed.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">I am sorry!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"If only I had realized sooner...! Then none of this...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> has no family left now.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="14">Her dad</STYLE> is dead, and <STYLE ID="9">her mom</STYLE> will surely never return to society.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">I'm sorry. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">It is our fault that </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> has been hurt this badly..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, that is not so! I stuck my nose in of my own accord, that is all...!"</STYLE><PG>
If I were thinking of <STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>'s happiness, I should not have handed <STYLE ID="9">Auntie</STYLE> over to the police.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At the very least, I should have left her one family member.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But I kicked that option away.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That was the best course, and the only justice I could manage.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was an Operation to keep the same wrong from being repeated.<PG>
But... the anger and the shaking will not settle after all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I myself, who had been no use for anything, was burning in that anger.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
To think that all I could do was break <STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>'s family apart...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
To think that all I did was make <STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> sadder still...<PG>
The Operation...
{PAUSE ""}
is a failure.<PG>
